WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.167
Split tangent bundles are products.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.260
If the tangent bundle splits in two integrable

3
00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.412
pieces, the cover should be a product.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.291
Grow product boxes and extend them across

5
00:00:11.291 --> 00:00:13.426
their edges, until they cover everything.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.536
Claimed: the two-summand case of Beauville.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.127
Main theorem Lean-checked.
